  "problem": "A series RCL circuit has a source electromotive force (EMF) of $10\\,\\text{V},$ a resistance of $60\\,Ω,$ a capacitance of $0.01\\,\\text{F},$ and an inductance of $L=20\\,\\text{H}.$ Find the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ (in coulombs) on the capacitor at time $t$ (in seconds).\n\n*Hint: The voltage drop ${V}_{C}$ across the capacitor is related to its charge by $q=C{V}_{C},$ where $C$ is the capacitance measured in Farads.*",
